DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The keyboard controller aattkkbbddcc provides I/O services for the AT keyboard
     and PS/2 mouse style pointing devices.  This controller is required for
     the keyboard driver aattkkbbdd and the PS/2 pointing device driver ppssmm.

     There can be only one aattkkbbddcc device configured in the system.

